# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ACIT 4640 — files that must NEVER be committed to a public repository.
#
# Anything matched here stays on your machine only. Git never tracks it, so it
# cannot reach GitHub even though it lives inside the repo folder.
#
# Before the first push, verify with:  git status --ignored
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Assessment material (quizzes contain inline ANSWER KEYS) ---
*Quiz*.md
*Quiz*.pdf
*Quiz*.docx
*Test*.md
*Test*.pdf
*Test*.docx
*Exam*.md
*Exam*.pdf
*Exam*.docx
*Midterm*
*Final*
*Answer*
*_Key.*
*Solution*
*Solutions*

# --- Slides (not published to the site) ---
*.pptx
*.potx
*.ppt
*.key

# --- Internal planning / instructor-only documents ---
ACIT4640_Notes_Timeline_Mapping.md
ACIT4640_Fall2026_Incus_Packer_Change_Plan.md
ACIT4640_Course_Outline.md

# --- Jekyll build artifacts ---
docs/_site/
docs/.jekyll-cache/
docs/.jekyll-metadata
docs/vendor/
.bundle/
Gemfile.lock

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
